,"provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":55213,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵两苏公讲筵唱和四首 其一","author":"晁补之","text":"白发归联侍从荣，未应江海叹飘零。\n禽鱼不与钧天观，想见群龙舞洞庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":55214,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵芸叟文潜体之观音院题名","author":"晁补之","text":"壁上栖鸦粉剥红，萍游无定得风同。\n故人妙墨何人识，文豹依依雾雨中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":55215,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵阎仲甫郎中病起二首 其一","author":"晁补之","text":"伏波七十老鍪弧，薏苡何曾适病躯。\n高卧输公无一事，评诗校画是功夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":55216,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵阎仲甫郎中病起二首 其二","author":"晁补之","text":"脱略轩裳陶隐居，肘书百卷事宁躯。\n茯苓日长东山涩，早晚柴车命仆夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":55217,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵提刑毅甫送茶","author":"晁补之","text":"炰羔煮饼渐宜秦，愁绝江南一味真。\n健步远梅安用插，鹧鸪金盏有馀春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":55218,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江心望彭泽作","author":"晁补之","text":"青山缺处大江奔，江口山颜见县门。\n一世定无纡辔处，故应来此著琴樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poe